      "normalizedSource": "When you invoke `disableScreenUpdatesUntilFlush`, you can make sure that a marked window gets displayed by returning control to the run loop on the main thread or by sending the window [`displayIfNeeded()`](nswindow/displayifneeded().md) or [`display()`](nswindow/display().md).",
